[{"text":"Coefficient2[exp, form1, form2, ...] is like Coefficient, but it also allows to extracts coefficients of form1, form2, ... sequentially. To specify the power in formi, write it as {var,pow}.","anchor":"coefficient2"},{"text":"To keep the prefactor whose coefficient you extracted you need to set the option Prefactor to True.","anchor":"coefficient2"},{"text":"Overview, Cases2.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"ex = y0 + ep y1 + a4 (1/ep x1 + x2 + x3 ep) + a4^2 (1/ep^2 z1 + 1/ep z2 + z3 + x4 ep)","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{a4}^2 \\left(\\frac{\\text{z1}}{\\text{ep}^2}+\\text{ep} \\;\\text{x4}+\\frac{\\text{z2}}{\\text{ep}}+\\text{z3}\\right)+\\text{a4} \\left(\\frac{\\text{x1}}{\\text{ep}}+\\text{ep} \\;\\text{x3}+\\text{x2}\\right)+\\text{ep} \\;\\text{y1}+\\text{y0}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, a4]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\text{x1}}{\\text{ep}}+\\text{ep} \\;\\text{x3}+\\text{x2}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, a4, 2]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\text{z1}}{\\text{ep}^2}+\\text{ep} \\;\\text{x4}+\\frac{\\text{z2}}{\\text{ep}}+\\text{z3}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, {a4, 2}]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\text{z1}}{\\text{ep}^2}+\\text{ep} \\;\\text{x4}+\\frac{\\text{z2}}{\\text{ep}}+\\text{z3}\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, {a4, 2}, {ep, -1}]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{z2}\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, {a4, 2}, ep]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{x4}\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, a4, 2, ep]","anchor":"cb7","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{x4}\\]","anchor":"cb7-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, {a4, 1}, {ep, 0}]","anchor":"cb8","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{x2}\\]","anchor":"cb8-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, a4, ep]","anchor":"cb9","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{x3}\\]","anchor":"cb9-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Coefficient2[ex, {a4, 1}, {ep, 0}, Prefactor -> True]","anchor":"cb10","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\text{a4} \\;\\text{x2}\\]","anchor":"cb10-1","section":"Examples"}]